---
layout: base.njk
title: Engineering analysis archive
description: A collection of deep dives into software engineering, architecture, and production post-mortems.
permalink: /articles/
---

<header class="mb-16">
  <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-black mb-4">
    Engineering analysis archive
  </h1>
  <p class="text-xl text-gray-500 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
    Deep dives into software engineering, architecture, and production post-mortems.
  </p>
</header>

<section class="mb-24">
  {%- for post in collections.post | reverse -%}
  <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="group block mb-12">
    <div class="border-l-2 border-gray-100 pl-6 group-hover:border-black transition-colors duration-300">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5 mb-2">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest">
          {{ post.date | dateDisplay if post.date else "" }}
        </span>
        {% if post.data.language %}
        <span class="text-gray-300">•</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider {% if post.data.language == 'italian' %}bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-100{% else %}bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 border border-purple-100{% endif %}">
          {{ post.data.language }}
        </span>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 group-hover:text-purple-700 transition-colors">
        {{ post.data.title }}
      </h3>
      <p class="text-gray-500 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        {{ post.data.description }}
      </p>
      <div class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 uppercase tracking-wide">
        Read full post &rarr;
      </div>
    </div>
  </a>
  {%- endfor -%}
</section>
